  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "学校のエンブレムが　きらめく　ボトル。軽くて　丈夫な　真空断熱　構造で保温から　保冷まで　バッチリ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "학교의 엠블럼이 반짝이는 보틀. 가볍고 튼튼한 진공 단열 구조로 되어 있어 보온 성능은 물론 보냉 성능도 완벽하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "校徽閃閃發亮的水壺。具備輕巧又堅固的真空隔熱構造，不論要保溫或保冷都不是問題。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une bouteille portant le blason de l’académie. Elle est légère, solide et isolée sous vide pour conserver vos boissons chaudes et froides à leur température idéale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Das Wappen der Akademie ziert diese ebenso robuste wie leichte Flasche, die Getränke dank Vakuumdämmung warm beziehungsweise kalt hält.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un termo decorado con el escudo de la academia. Ligero, resistente y muy bien aislado, conserva sin problema la temperatura de lo que se vierta en él.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Borraccia su cui brilla l’emblema della scuola. Leggera e resistente, la sua capacità isotermica permette di mantenere la temperatura di bevande calde e fredde.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A bottle emblazoned with the academy’s emblem. It’s light, sturdy, and vacuum insulated, so it’ll keep your hots hot and your colds cold.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "学校のエンブレムが　きらめく　ボトル。軽くて　丈夫な　真空断熱　構造で保温から　保冷まで　バッチリ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "校徽闪亮耀眼的水壶。轻巧坚固，采用了真空隔热的构造，由保温到保冷，功能一应俱全。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
